  "question": {
    "text": "The possible number of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which the common chord of the circles <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> subtends a right angle at the origin is"
