  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0086_8e152d2a768d.png\" style=\"width:2.08681in;height:2.08681in\" /><br />Equation of the common chord is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />If the chord <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> subtends a right angle at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> then the distance of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> from the origin is equal to <math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
  }
